---

---

<section id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-text fade-up">
        <span class="section-label">// about</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">
          Shipping systems that scale.<br />Now as an independent.
        </h2>
        <p>
          I'm <strong>Evgenii Mironenko</strong> — a software engineer with 12+ years
          of experience designing, building, and running large-scale software systems.
          For the past few years I've been a <strong
            >Staff Software Engineer at Miro</strong
          >, owning company-wide infrastructure and AI projects that serve
          hundreds of engineers and non-engineers alike.
        </p>
        <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">
          Recent highlights: a <strong
            >GraphRAG-powered internal knowledge assistant</strong
          > that unified data across engineering, product, customer support, and leadership;
          an
          <strong>AI triage system</strong> that automatically routes bug reports
          and feature requests; and the software catalog that gave 70+ engineering
          teams clear ownership of services, APIs, and tools — enabling automations
          across QA, security, and developer tooling.
        </p>
        <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">
          Outside the day-to-day, I spoke as a <strong
            >technical speaker at the Google Workspace Developer Summit</strong
          > in Amsterdam, and represented Miro as a
          <strong>featured partner at Microsoft Build</strong> in Seattle. I also
          worked directly with the teams at Google, Microsoft, Zoom, and Slack to
          build integrations that grew Miro's weekly active users by over 200K.
        </p>
        <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">
          I'm now taking on independent consulting work — bringing staff-level
          thinking and hands-on delivery to teams that need it. Based in
          Amsterdam, working across the Netherlands and remotely.
        </p>
        <div class="about-badges">
          <span class="badge">Amsterdam, NL</span>
          <span class="badge">Dutch ZZP</span>
          <span class="badge">Remote-friendly</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="about-photo fade-up">
        <div class="photo-frame">
          <img
            src="/me.jpg"
            alt="Evgenii Mironenko"
            width="320"
            height="320"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="photo-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  #about {
    background: transparent;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 320px;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about-text p {
    font-size: 1.025rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .about-text strong {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .about-text .section-title {
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .about-badges {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  .badge {
    font-family: "Fira Mono", monospace;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--teal);
    background: var(--teal-dim);
    border: 1px solid var(--teal-border);
    padding: 0.35rem 0.8rem;
    border-radius: 100px;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .photo-frame {
    position: relative;
    width: 320px;
    height: 320px;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .photo-frame img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    filter: grayscale(15%);
    transition: filter 0.4s ease;
  }
  .photo-frame:hover img {
    filter: grayscale(0%);
  }
  .photo-glow {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 40px rgba(0, 212, 200, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid var(--teal-border);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
    }
    .about-photo {
      order: -1;
    }
    .photo-frame {
      width: 200px;
      height: 200px;
    }
  }
</style>
